  "limitations": [
    "This is a radial neutrino-nucleon transport optical-depth estimate, not the heavy-flavor energy sphere. Transport and energy spheres are distinct.",
    "It assumes identical simple scattering opacity for neutrinos and antineutrinos and omits degeneracy, correlations, recoil, weak magnetism, pair absorption/emission, and angular transport.",
    "Equal polarization averaging is a kinematic reference; the actual production density matrix is channel- and phase-space-dependent.",
    "The outer density tail is extrapolated exponentially from a figure ending at 20 km.",
    "No full B.2 vector-ray integration is performed with this smooth pair escape model; it must not replace the published Rmax=25 km baseline."
  ],
